WEBVTT

00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:17,940
When running the new programs on the Atelier Robin, the light can be very dim and it can be hard to hear any noise.

00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:19,940
Is this normal?

00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:22,940
Yes it is.

00:00:22,940 --> 00:00:28,940
So if I have updated your programs and you have an Atelier Robin,

00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:38,940
I have put, I have rewrote literally every single program of all the 1500 other programs I literally rewrote.

00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:43,940
And I wrote them if it's appropriate in what's called the 11th harmonic.

00:00:43,940 --> 00:00:48,940
And when you're running the 11th harmonic, you're really running two frequencies at the same time.

00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:53,940
The primary treatment frequency and the 11th harmonic of that treatment frequency.

00:00:53,940 --> 00:01:05,940
And because you're running two frequencies, it really cancels out the noise and the light will appear much dimmer, especially if you have our new bulb.

00:01:05,940 --> 00:01:08,940
So the new bulb carries more gas.

00:01:08,940 --> 00:01:12,940
And the benefit of it, you're going to get more treatment from it.

00:01:12,940 --> 00:01:19,940
And the other benefit is it's not going to be nearly as bright because it's crystallized as well.

00:01:19,940 --> 00:01:26,940
So it's crystallized, it's running 11th harmonic and it's more gas in the bulb.

00:01:26,940 --> 00:01:28,940
So it's going to be a much dimmer bulb.

00:01:28,940 --> 00:01:34,940
Matter of fact, I tell people, we've had people call it, this is, I don't think this is working, turn off your lights.

00:01:34,940 --> 00:01:35,940
Oh, now I see it.

00:01:35,940 --> 00:01:38,940
It's really hard to see at all in the daytime.

00:01:38,940 --> 00:01:47,940
And the noise, especially if you're used to running a program that's not on the 11th harmonic of the lower frequencies, it's going to be much louder.

00:01:47,940 --> 00:01:53,940
But now running with the 11th harmonic, some of the higher frequencies you can't even hear the running.

00:01:53,940 --> 00:01:56,940
So yeah, it's just beware of that.

